---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import type {ImageMetadata} from 'astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {phone,url} from '../data/site';
import {centreDetails} from '../data/centre-detail-content';
type Photo={file:string;title:string;alt:string;image:ImageMetadata;full:string};
interface Props {
 content:typeof centreDetails[number];hero:ImageMetadata;emblem:ImageMetadata;share:ImageMetadata;gallery:Photo[];
 services:{icon:string;name:string;text:string;path:string}[];citation:string;
}
const {content,hero,emblem,share,gallery,services,citation}=Astro.props;
---
<article class="local-page status-page">
 <section class="local-hero local-wrap" aria-labelledby="local-title">
  <div>
   <p class="local-kicker"><Image src={emblem} alt="" width={54} height={54} format="webp" /> South Extension · New Delhi</p>
   <p class="local-service-line">Location status & family guidance</p>
   <h1 id="local-title">{content.headline} <em>{content.headlineAccent}</em></h1>
   <p class="local-lead">{content.lead}</p>
   <div class="local-actions"><a class="local-button" href={phone.href} data-cta="hero-call"><Icon name="phone" /> {phone.display}</a><a class="local-text-link" href={url('/centers')}>Explore our centre directory <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
   <p class="local-small"><a href={url('/national-autism-helpline')}>Free telephone guidance, 24/7.</a> Centre appointments and therapy are confirmed separately.</p>
   <div class="status-note"><strong>Before arranging a South Extension visit</strong><p>Our source workbook marks this location <strong>INACTIVE</strong>. Current operation and appointments are unconfirmed here. A facility-register approval dated 15 March 2026 is a separate record.</p><a href="#location-status">Understand the location status <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="local-hero-photo"><Image src={hero} alt={gallery.find(p=>p.file===content.hero)!.alt} widths={[320,480,720,960]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 40vw" format="webp" quality={85} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Source photograph of South Extension premises; it does not confirm current operation.</figcaption></figure>
 </section>
 <nav class="local-jump local-wrap" aria-label="On this location page"><a href="#location-status">Location status</a><a href="#available-options">Your next options</a><a href="#find-us">Recorded address</a><a href="#life-first">Why Pinnacle</a><a href="#centre-gallery">Premises photos</a><a href="#local-evidence">Evidence</a><a href="#questions">Questions</a></nav>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="location-status">
  <p class="local-kicker">A clear starting point</p><h2>Check the next step. <em>Then plan your journey.</em></h2>
  <p class="local-lead">{content.direct}</p>
  <div class="status-facts"><div class="local-card"><Icon name="pin" /><h3>Location source</h3><p>South Extension is marked INACTIVE in the retained workbook. We have not confirmed a current appointment at this address.</p></div><div class="local-card"><Icon name="plan" /><h3>Dated facility record</h3><p>HFR IN0710006582 has a certificate dated 15 March 2026 and a recorded Approved portal status. That register record does not establish present opening hours or available therapy.</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/hfr-register.html#hfr-IN0710006582')}>Inspect the facility source →</a></div><div class="local-card"><Icon name="phone" /><h3>What to confirm</h3><p>Ask our team about current operation, suitable support, the professional, appointment, fee and entrance access before travelling.</p><a href={phone.href}>Call 9100 181 181 →</a></div></div>
 </section>
 <section class="local-section status-options" id="available-options"><div class="local-wrap">
  <p class="local-kicker">Your child's life stays at the centre</p><h2>You can begin with <em>one useful conversation.</em></h2>
  <div class="status-facts"><div class="local-card"><Icon name="voice" /><h3>Tell us what matters.</h3><p>Describe a moment you want to make easier: asking for help, getting ready, playing together or joining learning. Ask what a suitable next step could involve.</p><a class="local-button" href={phone.href} data-cta="centre-call">{phone.display}</a></div><div class="local-card"><Icon name="pin" /><h3>Discuss a suitable location.</h3><p>Explore our directory and ask which options can currently be arranged. Confirm the actual service and appointment before booking travel.</p><a href={url('/centers')}>Find a Pinnacle centre →</a></div><div class="local-card"><Icon name="people" /><h3>Send your enquiry.</h3><p>Keep South Extension selected so our team understands which location you are asking about. An enquiry does not confirm a visit.</p><a href={content.enquiry} data-cta="centre-enquiry">Ask about available options →</a></div></div>
  <p class="local-small">We do not promise a Delhi appointment or remote therapy through this page. The receiving team confirms what can actually be arranged.</p>
 </div></section>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="find-us">
  <p class="local-kicker">Retained location reference</p><h2>The recorded <em>South Extension address.</em></h2>
  <div class="local-card"><address>{content.address}</address><p>The frontage photograph shows entrance steps. This address and the linked map help identify the recorded location; confirm current operation and the access your family needs before travelling.</p><a class="local-text-link" href={content.branch.mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cta="centre-maps"><Icon name="pin" /> View the recorded map location</a></div>
 </section>
 <section class="local-section local-life" id="life-first"><div class="local-wrap">
  <p class="local-kicker">The Pinnacle direction</p><h2>Start with your child's life. <em>Let the support serve it.</em></h2>
  <p class="local-lead">Growing self-sufficiency and mainstream participation give the work its purpose. We connect abilities, meaningful goals, suitable people and methods, everyday practice and review to that direction. Your family helps choose what matters and brings observations into the next decision.</p>
  <figure class="status-creative"><Image src={share} alt="Pinnacle Blooms Delhi guidance creative: call before you travel, 9100 181 181; a family and branded professional in an illustrative scene." widths={[480,720,1200]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 900px" format="webp" quality={85} loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <p>A home is more than its individual bricks. Likewise, practising a skill has a purpose in your child's day: choosing, communicating, getting ready or taking part. Ask us how the next step connects to the life you want to make possible.</p>
  <a class="local-text-link" href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>Explore our life-first approach <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
  <details class="local-sources" id="connected-pathway"><summary>How the seven connected stages serve that direction</summary><ol>{content.stages.map(stage=><li><a href={url(stage.path)}>{stage.title}</a> — {stage.text}</li>)}</ol><p>These explain our approach; they do not establish a current South Extension service or guarantee an individual result.</p></details>
 </div></section>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="everyday-example">
  <p class="local-kicker">An illustrative example to discuss</p><h2>{content.exampleTitle}</h2><p class="local-lead">{content.exampleQuestion}</p><ol class="branch-example">{content.exampleSteps.map(([title,text],i)=><li class="local-card"><span class="local-stage-number">{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></li>)}</ol>
 </section>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="support">
  <p class="local-kicker">Understand the contributions</p><h2>Explore the support. <em>Ask what fits your child.</em></h2><p>These service pages explain different contributions. The actual location, service and professional must be confirmed with our team.</p><div class="local-service-grid">{services.map(service=><a class="local-card local-service" href={url(service.path)}><Icon name={service.icon} /><h3>{service.name}</h3><p>{service.text}</p><strong>Understand this support →</strong></a>)}</div><p><a href={url('/autism-therapy')}>See how suitable therapies can connect around your child's life →</a></p>
 </section>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="first-visit">
  <p class="local-kicker">Before choosing a visit</p><h2>Get the practical details <em>confirmed first.</em></h2><ol class="local-visit"><li><Icon name="voice" /><h3>Describe your priorities.</h3><p>Tell us your city, your child's everyday needs and what you hope to make possible.</p></li><li><Icon name="pin" /><h3>Confirm the actual option.</h3><p>Check the location's current operation, suitable support, available professional, appointment, fees and what is included.</p></li><li><Icon name="people" /><h3>Plan travel after confirmation.</h3><p>Check the exact address and entrance, steps or lift access your family needs. An enquiry or facility record alone is not a confirmed appointment.</p></li></ol>
 </section>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="centre-gallery">
  <p class="local-kicker">Location reference photographs</p><h2>Recognise the recorded <em>premises.</em></h2><div class="branch-gallery">{gallery.map(photo=><figure><a href={photo.full} aria-label={'Open full photograph: '+photo.title}><Image src={photo.image} alt={photo.alt} widths={[240,400,600]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 44vw" format="webp" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>{photo.title} · <a href={photo.full}>Open full photo</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="local-small">These retained first-party photographs are matched to South Extension. They do not establish current operation, rooms, equipment or appointment availability.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="local-section local-proof" id="local-evidence"><div class="local-wrap">
  <p class="local-kicker">Evidence with a clear purpose</p><h2>Inspect the record. <em>Keep its scope clear.</em></h2><div class="local-proof-grid">{content.sources.filter(source=>['hfr','identity','purpose','md5','bis'].includes(source.id)).map(source=><div class="local-card"><Icon name="plan" /><h3>{source.name}</h3><p>{source.displayScope||source.scope}</p><a href={source.url}>Read the source →</a></div>)}</div>
  <details class="local-sources"><summary>Sources, reading exports and citation</summary><ul>{content.sources.map(source=><li><a href={source.url}>{source.name}</a> — {source.scope}</li>)}</ul><p><a href={'/pinnacle-pages-data/'+content.id+'-evidence.json'}>Source map · JSON</a> · <a href={'/pinnacle-pages-data/'+content.id+'-evidence.txt'}>Text</a> · <a href={'/pinnacle-pages-data/'+content.id+'-machine.md'}>Markdown</a></p><blockquote>{citation}</blockquote><button class="local-button local-outline" type="button" id="local-copy-citation" data-cta="centre-copy-citation">Copy this citation</button><p id="local-citation-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></details>
 </div></section>
 <section class="local-section local-wrap" id="questions"><p class="local-kicker">Useful answers before calling</p><h2>A clear next step <em>for Delhi families.</em></h2><div class="local-faq">{content.faqs.map(faq=><details><summary>{faq.question}</summary><p>{faq.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
 <section class="local-section local-close"><div class="local-wrap"><h2>Tell us what you want to <em>make possible.</em></h2><p class="local-lead">Your child's life gives the conversation its direction. Call our national team, check the current options and choose your next step with clarity.</p><div class="local-actions"><a class="local-button" href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call"><Icon name="phone" /> {phone.display}</a><a class="local-button local-outline" href={content.enquiry} data-cta="final-enquiry">Ask about options <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div><div class="local-share"><button type="button" id="local-share" data-cta="centre-share">Share this location information</button><a href={'https://wa.me/?text='+encodeURIComponent('Pinnacle Blooms Delhi: call 9100 181 181 before travelling to South Extension. '+url(content.path))} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cta="centre-whatsapp">Share via WhatsApp</a><a href={url('/centers')}>Explore our centre directory</a></div><p id="local-share-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section>
</article>
<style>
 a:not(.local-button){text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em}
 .branch-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.6rem;margin-top:2rem}.branch-gallery figure{margin:0}.branch-gallery img{width:100%;height:auto;max-height:460px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:28px;background:#f5f8fa}.branch-gallery figcaption{font-weight:700;line-height:1.7;margin-top:.8rem}.branch-example{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));list-style:none;padding:0;gap:1rem;margin-block:2rem}@media(max-width:1024px){.branch-example{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:760px){.branch-gallery,.branch-example{grid-template-columns:1fr}.branch-gallery img{max-height:430px}}
 .status-note{margin-top:1.4rem;padding:1.2rem;border-left:5px solid #00838d;border-radius:0 18px 18px 0;background:#effafa}.status-note p{margin:.6rem 0}.status-note a{font-weight:700;color:#075f68}.status-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.2rem}.status-facts a{font-weight:700}.status-options{background:#f6f2fc}.status-creative{max-width:1000px;margin:2rem auto;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px}.status-creative img{width:100%;height:auto}.status-page address{font-size:1.2rem;font-style:normal;line-height:1.7}.status-page .local-sources li{margin-block:.8rem}.status-page .local-sources ol{padding-left:1.6rem}@media(max-width:760px){.status-facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.status-note{padding:1rem}.status-creative{border-radius:16px}}
</style>
